[gd_scene load_steps=10 format=3 uid="uid://c3pillars001"]

; Concordia Three Pillars — Godot 4 tableau (LORE_BIBLE §1).
; Equilateral triangle on XZ, closed loop, nobody reaches.
;   Concord  ──loves──►  Concordia  ──fond of──►  The Sovereign
;      ▲                                                │
;      └──────────────── won't turn around ◄────────────┘
; Facing uses Godot -Z look convention.
; Concordia at +Z apex looks at Sovereign (+X). Concord at -X looks at her.
; Sovereign at +X faces outward — too proud to turn.

